["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"17.【趨勢2023】沉悶的港股會好嗎、富豪的家辦與苦惱 Family Office Trustee Boy Leverage Insurance PI客戶 Long Only\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2023-03-03-zhangxiaojun-家族办公室比家族还多-香港的财富管理时代才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a527783c09130bf7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0303</span></div>\n<h2>家族辦公室比家族還多，香港的財富管理時代才剛開始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">港股從14000點反彈50%只是情緒修復，真正的新趨勢是香港從Fintech轉向Wealth Management——但家辦門檻低到沒有牌照要求，魚龍混雜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">港股</span><span class=\"tag\">家族辦公室</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"16.【趨勢2023】那些掙到錢、消失的互聯網中高層去哪了 Individual Contributor stakeholder social listening vintage\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2023-02-16-zhangxiaojun-互联网中高层出走率接近三分之二-但这不是年龄问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd9c22e61c238c2f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0216</span></div>\n<h2>互聯網中高層出走率接近三分之二，但這不是年齡問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互聯網二十年高增長靠技術紅利和用戶紅利，紅利掩蓋了管理能力的缺失；今天組織膨脹變成內耗，出走是行業自我校正，而不是35歲危機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互聯網</span><span class=\"tag\">職業經理人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"14. 香港的語言政策、曖昧和青年迷思 兩文三語 微調教學語言 吳慶瑞報告書 特選學校 Burlister liberal studies\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2023-01-31-zhangxiaojun-香港两文三语只有3-到5-的人能做到-这是个失败的政策/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21c3ed4be09c6fe3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0131</span></div>\n<h2>香港兩文三語只有3%到5%的人能做到，這是個失敗的政策</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">香港堅持一個只有3%到5%的人能達到的語言政策目標，而新加坡用50年、三代人完成了從雙語並重到英文為主的轉向，代價是消滅方言和壓制反對派。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香港</span><span class=\"tag\">語言政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"13. 郵輪小史，去尋找海面上的烏托邦 White Star old money freestyle godmother\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2023-01-20-zhangxiaojun-邮轮巨头靠并购做大-为造船收购船厂的那家破产了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/36d7711868e85f95-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0120</span></div>\n<h2>郵輪巨頭靠併購做大，為造船收購船廠的那家破產了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">嘉年華幾十年裡把白星、冠達這些老牌公司一家家買下來，最多時手上約100條船；雲頂為了造20萬噸巨輪去收購德國船廠，資金被套在裡面，最後破產。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">郵輪</span><span class=\"tag\">旅遊業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"12. 和黃宇翔聊東南亞另5國：小國的扈從和對沖 hedging multi-directional reconciliation The Art of Not Being Governed\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2023-01-16-zhangxiaojun-小国不站队-东南亚五国的对冲术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccaf62c904030e05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0116</span></div>\n<h2>小國不站隊：東南亞五國的對沖術</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">緬甸、老撾、柬埔寨、文萊、東帝汶這五個小國，很少一邊倒，而是農業靠一家、國防靠另一家，用多向量外交在大國之間做對沖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">東南亞</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"11. 新加坡的淘金熱和政商環境 Token2049 Terra FTX 淡馬錫 沙盒\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2023-01-09-zhangxiaojun-新加坡不是-web3-中心-只是全球淘金者的避难所/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/69d6c01b93fc11e5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0109</span></div>\n<h2>新加坡不是 Web3 中心，只是全球淘金者的避難所</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新加坡政府從 2010 年就給官員發比特幣做實驗，但它體量太小、技術人員太少，註定只能當樞紐而非中心。真正值錢的是它用企業方式運作政府、給創業公司報銷 70% 參展費的那套機制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新加坡</span><span class=\"tag\">Web3</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"10. 加州土著談硅谷精神與職場：You can be totally weird! learning to unlearn chief of staff data loss prevention narrative\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-12-31-zhangxiaojun-硅谷土著-在硅谷你可以完全怪-人们会拥抱你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/398250c8a95fc6d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1231</span></div>\n<h2>硅谷土著：在硅谷你可以完全怪，人們會擁抱你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一位在舊金山灣區長大35年的加州土著說，硅谷真正難複製的是那種氣氛——你可以完全怪，人們會擁抱你；而中國創業者去美國融資，最缺的往往不是細節，是講故事的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"9. 加更英文原聲版：口述一部硅谷風投史 The Power Law Liberation Capital growth investing the strength of weak ties vaporware\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-12-30-zhangxiaojun-风投靠的不是眼光-是把一次性赌博变成可重复的游戏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8d0a44507b6d3c62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1230</span></div>\n<h2>風投靠的不是眼光，是把一次性賭博變成可重複的遊戲</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬拉比寫硅谷風投史，最值錢的一條機制是：風投用網絡把創業者的一次性賭博變成可重複的遊戲，所以他管風投叫「製造勇氣的機器」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span><span class=\"tag\">硅谷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"8. 和暢銷書作家馬拉比聊《The Power Law》：硅谷風投的起源、秘密和大人物肖像 The Power Law LP GP Vaporware 弱關係的強度\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-12-26-zhangxiaojun-红杉能长盛不衰-凯鹏华盈却掉队-差别在领导者管不管内部/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5aa54d7a33404e0b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1226</span></div>\n<h2>紅杉能長盛不衰，凱鵬華盈卻掉隊：差別在領導者管不管內部</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">凱鵬華盈跌出榜首、紅杉持續領先，最大區別是領導者是否把精力花在內部管理上——如何招年輕投資人、如何培養、如何讓週一早晨那張決策桌保持活力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span><span class=\"tag\">紅杉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"7. 和談婧聊：硅谷凍卵歷險記和Web3環球旅行 biological clock product market fit venture doubt Network States crypto house\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-11-25-zhangxiaojun-冻卵不是把青春取出来-是把浪费掉的卵子拿出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6bf8ae5eb7e86050-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1125</span></div>\n<h2>凍卵不是把青春取出來，是把浪費掉的卵子拿出來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">女性每個月排二十多個卵子只用一個，凍卵取的是原本被浪費掉的那批，不是提前透支未來的四百個——所以它不折損青春，反而把人生的截止日期挪掉了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">凍卵</span><span class=\"tag\">Web3</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"6. 顯微鏡下的硅谷大裁員：一筆筆現實經濟賬 Level.FYI Cobra H1B P&amp;L IC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-11-21-zhangxiaojun-meta-裁员补偿-4-n-2-有绿卡是幸福-没绿卡是倒计时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32e62e38accb0559-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">33:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>Meta 裁員補償 4+N/2：有綠卡是幸福，沒綠卡是倒計時</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一場 Meta 裁員，有綠卡的人拿著十幾萬美金去新公司上班，沒綠卡的人要在四個月內、還是節假日窗口裡找到下一份工作，否則就得離開美國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷裁員</span><span class=\"tag\">Meta</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"5. 和黃宇翔聊東南亞6國：政治、殺戮和國父 monarchy network indirect rule First Among Equals People Power Revolution\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-11-12-zhangxiaojun-东南亚的管制能力-多是屠杀和战争的副产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c0a370cf86c573-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>東南亞的管制能力，多是屠殺和戰爭的副產品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投資東南亞先看政權能不能把政令推到最基層：這種管制能力，印尼來自一場屠殺後的清洗，越南來自十幾年戰爭，跟經濟增速無關。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">東南亞</span><span class=\"tag\">出海投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"4.【到全世界創業生活】尋訪越南：最後一個待開掘的儒家社會 儒家社會 亞洲四小龍 奧黛 朝陽大媽\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-10-18-zhangxiaojun-越南不会成为世界工厂-但可能是最后一个儒家新兴市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21038a22ff8cf135-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>越南不會成為世界工廠，但可能是最後一個儒家新興市場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">越南人均 GDP 只有 3700 美金，相當於中國 2003 年。它的機會不是複製中國全產業鏈，而是像亞洲四小龍那樣選幾個行業做到發達國家水平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">越南</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"3. 宇航員與機器人：漫談深邃浪漫的ROBOT新知 in-hand manipulation DARPA Robotic Challenge silver bullet product market fit DLR\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-10-10-zhangxiaojun-让机器人削个土豆就能当院士-这比登火星更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd4230dec43e1a9d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">58:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>讓機器人削個土豆就能當院士，這比登火星更難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">登火星的技術人類大部分已經有了，只是個經濟問題；但怎麼讓機器人在廚房裡工作，人類現在還不知道，甚至還沒有思路——誰能讓機器人削個土豆，可以當院士。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"2. 和曹巍聊聊馬斯克、機器人恐怖谷和《西部世界》 uncanny valley iToF SLAM 力控\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-10-03-zhangxiaojun-人形机器人最难的环节不是走路-是穿针剥虾/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2834a742a2c9e6e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">55:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>人形機器人最難的環節不是走路，是穿針剝蝦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雙足行走和自主導航都能沿襲特斯拉自動駕駛的積累，精準力控和觸覺不能——那要模擬人的皮膚，開車時根本用不到。第一版、第二版機器人大概只到人的 20% 到 30%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"1. 和投資人夢秋聊聊加州、投資寒潮和林黛玉 Bubble Burst 持幣待購\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-07-11-zhangxiaojun-资本寒冬不是缺钱-是大家都在持币待购/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e3f2f9d0bed1e26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">54:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0711</span></div>\n<h2>資本寒冬不是缺錢，是大家都在持幣待購</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「資本寒冬」每兩三年就被喊一次，通常六到八個月就過去。這次不一樣：兩頭在外的美元通路被打斷，不是沒錢，而是不知道該怎麼投。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一級市場</span><span class=\"tag\">資本寒冬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"串臺《硅谷101》｜TikTok如何在Facebook眼皮底下成長起來？ UP 值 UG 中臺 Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-05-16-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-在-facebook-眼皮底下长大-靠的不是产品而是体系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83f0cc536109ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">38:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 在 Facebook 眼皮底下長大，靠的不是產品而是體系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字節贏在體系而非個人：推薦算法、UG 中臺、商業化三套系統疊加 Musical.ly 的產品殼，再用對標 Facebook 的 UP 值打法下狠手投放，才跑出全球第五大社交應用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"《TikTok內幕：張一鳴的巨浪征途》音頻版（下集） UG PMO GDPR All-Hands Meeting\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-05-05-zhangxiaojun-不留空档全面压制-tiktok-花-100-亿美元砸出护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3c064d7b78c0bb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">45:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0505</span></div>\n<h2>不留空檔全面壓制：TikTok 花 100 億美元砸出護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 全球化的第一推力是錢和一條暗號：幾年間投入約 100 億美元買量、補貼內容、砸服務器，對手要攔至少得準備 200 到 300 億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字節跳動</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"《TikTok內幕：張一鳴的巨浪征途》音頻版（上集） ARPU Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-04-29-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-曾是-facebook-最尊贵的客户-直到日活破亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/297c1019274060ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">35:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0429</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 曾是 Facebook 最尊貴的客戶，直到日活破億</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 早期最重要的投放渠道是 Facebook，推廣預算每個季度增長 100% 以上；Facebook 認定它留存太差、留不住用戶，反而把流量導給它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>"]